摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Desktop notifications for DeepSeek Harness turn completions, with per-outcome controls and include/exclude keyword rules.","id":"gh:1333068254","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-notification","slug":"omdsh-dev/dsh-notification","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Desktop notifications for DeepSeek Harness turn completions, with per-outcome controls and include/e"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"xclude keyword rules."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-notification"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Desktop notifications for the DeepSeek Harness web GUI. When a session finishes a turn, the browser "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"shows a system notification (via the `Notification` API), so you can switch tabs and still know when"},{"id":"p3s3","text":" DSH is done. Per-outcome toggles and include/exclude keyword rules control exactly which completion"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"one. Per-outcome toggles and include/exclude keyword rules control exactly which completions notify."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"No harness change is needed: the host contributes a session projection (a bounded summary of each se"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ssion's last completed turn), and the client watches the session list's completion reminder and appl"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ies its own persisted preferences."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Restart the web server so the host half and the served client bundle pick up the plugin. The default"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" `dsh web` profile has the required client composition (the session list, the settings shell, and lo"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"web` profile has the required client composition (the session list, the settings shell, and locale)."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Version `0.1.4` supports both the 0.1.1 and 0.1.2 Harness client package layouts and projection cont"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"n `0.1.4` supports both the 0.1.1 and 0.1.2 Harness client package layouts and projection contracts."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The settings section lives under **Settings > Notifications**."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Settings"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Setting | Default | Effect |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Enable notifications | on | Master switch; off stops every notification while keeping rules. |\n| N"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"otify on completed / error / aborted / blocked / token limit | completed + error on, rest off | Whic"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"h turn-end reasons notify (the host projection reports the reason). |\n| Keyword rules | none | Inclu"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"de/exclude filters matched against the session title, the turn's reply text, and its tool names. Inc"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"lude rules: at least one must match. Exclude rules: a match suppresses. Rules support literal or reg"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"ex matching with an optional case-sensitive flag. |\n| Require manual dismiss | off | The notificatio"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"n stays until dismissed. |\n| Only notify when the task is out of view | on | Suppress a notification"},{"id":"p13s8","text":" only when its session is currently in view. A completion still notifies while the page is hidden or"},{"id":"p13s9","text":" while another session/workspace is open. Turn it off to notify even for the session being watched. "},{"id":"p13s10","text":"Notifications for the same session replace each other. |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Preferences persist in the browser (localStorage). The section also grants browser permission and se"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"nds a test notification."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Host-side tunables live on the plugin row in `cordis.yml`:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Model experience"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Aspect | Effect |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Token cost | None — notifications are UI-only and never enter a request. |\n| Tool calls | None — t"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"he model gets no new tool. |\n| Session log | Unchanged — the projection reads the existing log and a"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"dds no events. |\n| Prompt | Unchanged — no system-prompt section is registered. |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Permission boundary"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- The host folds a pure projection over the session log (turn reason, bounded reply text, tool names"},{"id":"p22s2","text":") and the projection seam delivers it to the browser; the plugin writes nothing to the log and regis"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ters no model-facing tools.\n- The client watches the session list's completion reminder (a live \"fin"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"ished while not selected\" edge the runtime already computes) and shows a notification only when the "},{"id":"p22s5","text":"user has granted Notification permission.\n- Rule matching runs client-side against the projected con"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"tent; the reply body never exceeds `maxBodyChars`."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The repo expects the harness checkout at `../dsh` for the dev-time `link:` resolutions. The composit"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ion spec boots the real `SessionStore` and `SessionProjectionRegistry` and proves the fold."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- Notifications require the page to be open (the browser shows them while it is hidden, but not afte"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"r the tab is closed) and Notification permission granted; a denied site permission cannot be overrid"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"den from inside the page.\n- Notifications fire once per finished turn (a running→idle edge on any se"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ssion); a completion that happened while the page was disconnected is not re-notified on reconnect.\n"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"- The rule subject is the session title plus the last turn's reply text and tool names — earlier tur"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"ns are not matched.\n- Notification body is a flat text snippet; the click action only focuses the wi"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"ndow (no deep link to the turn)."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
